Product Requirements Document (PRD)
Smart Loan Lifecycle Management System

1. Project Overview
Product Name
Smart Loan Lifecycle Management System
Product Type
Web-based Financial Management Platform
Domain
FinTech / NBFC / Banking
Purpose
The purpose of this platform is to digitally manage the complete loan lifecycle process for NBFCs and banks, including loan application, document verification, approval workflow, EMI generation, repayment tracking, analytics, and defaulter management.
The system will help financial institutions reduce manual operations, improve loan processing speed, enhance transparency, and provide better customer service.

2. Problem Statement
Traditional loan management systems rely heavily on manual paperwork and disconnected workflows, leading to:


Slow loan approvals


Data management issues


Human errors


Poor repayment tracking


Delayed customer communication


Difficult defaulter management


A centralized digital solution is required to automate and streamline the loan management process.

3. Objectives


Automate the loan lifecycle process


Provide secure borrower onboarding


Enable digital document management


Simplify loan approval workflows


Automate EMI schedule generation


Provide real-time repayment tracking


Improve transparency and reporting


Reduce operational costs



4. Target Users
Borrowers
People applying for personal, education, vehicle, or business loans.
Loan Officers
Employees responsible for application verification and approval.
Admin
System administrators managing users, loans, and reports.

